{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act43side_level_act43side_st03","storyGroup":"act43side","storySort":19,"storyDependence":"act43side_level_act43side_08_end","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"AD-ST-3","storyName":"致观众","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"蒂比探望在狱中的莫伊拉。《杜邦夫人》的成片颇具争议，成为了电影节最受关注的作品。新酒神卢西恩在影院与剧作家和暮落见面，并准备踏上新的旅程。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act43side/level_act43side_st03","avgTag":"幕间","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act43side_st03","minState":"PLAYED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":17,"characters":["蒂比","莫伊拉","斯蒂芬","格蕾塔","米兰妮","兴奋的记者A","兴奋的记者B","雅拉","观众A","观众B","霍汀","剧作家","卢西恩","暮落"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"stopmusic","id":1},{"type":"dialog","id":2},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":3},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":4},{"type":"charslot","id":5},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$warm_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_warm_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":6,"musicid":0},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8d/Avg_bg_bg_cellroomC.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":7},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":8},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":9},{"type":"animtext","id":10,"name":"group_location_stamp","style":"avg_both","pos":"-400,-200","block":"false","text":"<p=1>哥伦比亚，蓝卡坞郊外，联邦移动监狱</><p=2>两个月后</>"},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":11},{"type":"animtextclean","id":12},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":13},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#2$1","duration":"1.5","id":14},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#1$3","duration":"1.5","id":15},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":16},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":17},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#1$3","focus":"n","id":18},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"莫丽，你瘦了好多啊！","id":19},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#9$3","focus":"r","id":20},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"毕竟在床上躺了两个月嘛。","id":21,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6f/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-9$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":22},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"当时地块停下来的第一时间我就去找你了。我看到医护人员抬着你出来，你浑身都是血，一动不动，我以为你已经......","id":23,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/97/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#1$3","focus":"r","id":24},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"他的歌声......很可怕。","id":25,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a7/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-1$3.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"但他只是想让我停下来，没有对我下死手。","id":26,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a7/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-1$3.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"他绝对不是像格蕾塔说的那样，在剧本拍卖会上与她偶遇，被说服后跟来剧组的，他另有目的。","id":27,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a7/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-1$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#10$1","focus":"l","id":28},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"另有目的？","id":29,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/28/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#1$3","focus":"r","id":30},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"他在找某个存在，某个就在我们身边但我们一无所知的存在。","id":31,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a7/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-1$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#10$1","focus":"l","id":32},{"type":"multiline","name":"蒂比","text":"啊，我本来就觉得卢西恩很神秘，你这么一说我更云里雾里了......","id":33},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":34},{"type":"multiline","name":"蒂比","end":"true","text":"算了不说他了！","id":35},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":36},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"真对不起啊莫丽，过了这么久才来看你。主要是、主要是联邦移动监狱的探视申请有点麻烦......","id":37,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/97/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#5$3","focus":"r","id":38},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"我知道的，蒂比。","id":39,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bd/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-5$3.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"我利用了你，害你被误会......","id":40,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bd/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-5$3.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"卢西恩先生说得没错，我甚至忽略了我本就拥有的真实。在我陷入癫狂的最后时刻，我甚至，没能想起你......","id":41,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bd/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-5$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":42},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"莫丽，你听我说。","id":43,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8e/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"无论你经历了什么，无论你出于什么目的，你都伤害了那些和我们朝夕相处的人，你犯下了罪孽，我永远、永远都不会原谅你！","id":44,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8e/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":45},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"......但是莫丽，这并不影响我怀念那些我们两个人窝在沙发里看恐怖片的时光。","id":46,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/97/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"那么快乐，那么真实，不是吗？","id":47,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/97/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#5$3","focus":"r","id":48},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"......是啊。","id":49,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bd/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-5$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#12$3","focus":"r","id":50},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"躺在病床上的时候，伤口很疼，睡不着，我就一直在回想这段时间发生的一切......","id":51,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c2/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-12$3.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"一整夜过去，只有我自己的疼痛是最真实的。","id":52,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c2/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-12$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#5$3","focus":"r","id":53},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"其实，无论故事被写得多么荒唐，无论我们是不是命运的傀儡，我并不是没有机会。","id":54,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bd/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-5$3.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"如果我们在一起看电影的时候，我能更专心一些，而不是去想那些我以为自己看到的真相，仇恨和疯狂，鲜血和人偶......","id":55,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bd/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-5$3.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"对不起，蒂比。","id":56,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bd/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-5$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":57},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"如果我可以早点遇见你的话，或许你就不需要“劳拉”了......","id":58,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/97/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":59},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":60},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":61},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"过两天就是最终的庭审了吧？我咨询过几位律师，好像......","id":62,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/97/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#1$3","focus":"r","id":63},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"......","id":64,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a7/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-1$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":65},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"......","id":66,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/97/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#9$3","focus":"r","id":67},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"不用在意结果，蒂比。","id":68,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6f/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-9$3.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"典狱长人很好，他允许我最后这几天待在监狱的后勤部门，去做一些犯人们用得着的东西。","id":69,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6f/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-9$3.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"我并不是，像之前那样，虚妄地等待最后的......","id":70,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6f/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-9$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":71},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"那就好、那就好。","id":72,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8e/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#9$3","focus":"r","id":73},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"哈哈，你探视的时间好像不多了，说点开心的事情吧。","id":74,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6f/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-9$3.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"剧组拍的那部电影最后怎么样了？","id":75,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6f/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-9$3.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":76},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":77},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":78},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":79},{"type":"charslot","id":80},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_crwddiscuss_inside","loop":"true","channel":"cr","volume":"0","id":81},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.2","channel":"cr","fadetime":"2","id":82},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/52/Avg_bg_62_g1_setting_lobby.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":83},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$m_dia_street_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta3_181101/m_dia_street_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":84,"musicid":1},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":85},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":86},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":87},{"type":"animtext","id":88,"name":"group_location_stamp","style":"avg_both","pos":"-400,-200","block":"false","text":"<p=1>哥伦比亚，蓝卡坞主城区，“另类电影节”展映现场</><p=2>一天前</>"},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":89},{"type":"animtextclean","id":90},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":91},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"cr","fadetime":"2","id":92},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_carpet_normal_fts","volume":"1","id":93},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1835_1#1$1","posfrom":"70,0","posto":"70,0","duration":"1.5","id":94},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#1$1","posfrom":"-70,0","posto":"-70,0","duration":"1.5","id":95},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":96},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1830_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","id":97},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":98},{"type":"charslot","id":99},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","volume":"1","loop":"true","channel":"a","id":100},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"a","fadetime":"1.5","id":101},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#1$1","duration":"1","isblock":"true","id":102},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":103},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"哇，大家都已经在了啊，对不起我来迟了！","id":104,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":105},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1835_1#7$1","id":106},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯蒂芬","text":"......","id":107,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_npc_1835_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#1$1","id":108},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"斯蒂芬，紧张吗？","id":109,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a6/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1835_1#7$1","id":110},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯蒂芬","text":"有一点。","id":111,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_npc_1835_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#1$1","id":112},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"放轻松。","id":113,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a6/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"最后的拍摄以那样荒唐的方式结束，剪辑、调色、音乐制作......两个月的时间完成后期制作，每个人都已经尽力了。","id":114,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a6/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1830_1#2$1","id":115},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"斯蒂芬，很高兴在电影名的修改上，我们达成了共识。","id":116,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1835_1#2$1","id":117},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯蒂芬","text":"米兰妮女士，也感谢您最后在天灾中的那段表演。否则，删去那两个字只是我个人的一些矫情的自我斗争。","id":118,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b8/Avg_avg_npc_1835_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1830_1#2$1","id":119},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"《杜邦夫人》显然没《杜邦夫人之死》那么有噱头，宣发的事情就让格蕾塔去头疼吧......但毫无疑问，这是最适合故事的名字。","id":120,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#1$1","id":121},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"交给我吧。","id":122,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a6/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"multiline","name":"格蕾塔","text":"我会让《杜邦夫人》顺利上映......","id":123},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#6$1","id":124},{"type":"multiline","name":"格蕾塔","end":"true","text":"然后我会去一趟警局，做我该做的事情。","id":125},{"type":"dialog","id":126},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_crwddiscuss_inside","loop":"true","channel":"cr","volume":"1","id":127},{"type":"charslot","duration":"0.5","isblock":"true","id":128},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":129},{"type":"playsound","key":"$skill_flash","volume":"1","id":130},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":131},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","id":132},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.05","block":"true","id":133},{"type":"delay","time":"0.6","id":134},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","id":135},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.05","block":"true","id":136},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.2","channel":"cr","fadetime":"2","id":137},{"type":"dialogue","name":"兴奋的记者A","text":"你掐一下我，我没眼花吧？","id":138},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":139},{"type":"dialogue","name":"兴奋的记者B","text":"掐个屁，快拍快拍！这绝对是明天的头条！","id":140},{"type":"dialogue","name":"兴奋的记者B","text":"“另类电影节”这种有点冷门的艺术类评奖，居然能吸引到这么重量级的嘉宾出席？组委会砸了多少钱？","id":141},{"type":"dialogue","name":"兴奋的记者A","text":"玛丽安娜女士已经有多少年没在蓝卡坞出现过了？","id":142},{"type":"dialog","id":143},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"cr","fadetime":"2","id":144},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_higheldshosfts","volume":"1","id":145},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_893_1#1$1","posfrom":"150,0","posto":"150,0","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","id":146},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":147},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雅拉","text":"......","id":148,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c9/Avg_avg_npc_893_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":149},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","volume":"1","loop":"true","channel":"a","id":150},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"a","fadetime":"1","id":151},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":152},{"type":"playsound","key":"$bodyfalldown3","volume":"1","id":153},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#1$1","posfrom":"200,0","posto":"-50,0","duration":"0.5","id":154},{"type":"delay","time":"0.4","id":155},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_893_1#4$1","afrom":"1","ato":"1","posfrom":"150,0","posto":"130,0","duration":"0.2","id":156},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":157},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":158},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"雅拉奶奶！","id":159,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_893_1#5$1","focus":"l","id":160},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雅拉","text":"好久不见，小蒂比。","id":161,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/52/Avg_avg_npc_893_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":162},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","posfrom":"-50,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"1","id":163},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"130,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"1.5","id":164},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":165},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_893_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":166},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雅拉","text":"你这身装扮......唔，让我猜猜你如今在剧组里是什么身份，场记？道具师？特技演员，“家具城战士”那种？","id":167,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c9/Avg_avg_npc_893_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#11$1","focus":"r","id":168},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"是场景喷绘师啦！","id":169,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"我干了大半年了，我还被选进了蓝卡坞的拍摄地块修复团队呢，上周的事情！","id":170,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":171},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"我们剧组租借的那个地块不是已经被天灾毁得不像样子了嘛，老大让我负责它在重建后的设计工作，忙得团团转......","id":172,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_893_1#5$1","focus":"l","id":173},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雅拉","text":"哈哈，看起来你终于确定了自己要从事什么。","id":174,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/52/Avg_avg_npc_893_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":175},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"我跟您说过的，我喜欢电影，我喜欢它的每一个环节每一个组成部分......","id":176,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"现在，我终于找到了自己在其中最最喜欢的是什么！","id":177,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_893_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":178},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雅拉","text":"所以，还是不打算回去？","id":179,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c9/Avg_avg_npc_893_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#11$1","focus":"r","id":180},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"嘿嘿，老头子那边，您继续帮我打打掩护嘛。","id":181,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_893_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":182},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雅拉","text":"小蒂比，你的爷爷是我曾经在蓝卡坞最好的合作伙伴，多年的好朋友，但这并不代表他会在教育孩子的事情上听我的意见。","id":183,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c9/Avg_avg_npc_893_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":184},{"type":"multiline","name":"蒂比","text":"您就在下次和他喝茶的时候这么说，","id":185},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":186},{"type":"multiline","name":"蒂比","end":"true","text":"咳咳——","id":187},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":188},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"“老家伙，我们都已经退休啦，就没必要管那么多啦......”","id":189,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8e/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":190},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"“你看，小蒂比没有利用你的任何资源，没有按照你的规划去当历史片导演，不也在蓝卡坞生活得很好？”","id":191,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6e/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":192},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"“未来，说不定蓝卡坞一半的拍摄场景都是你孙女喷绘的呢！”","id":193,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_893_1#10$1","focus":"l","id":194},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雅拉","text":"好的，我已经录下来了，下次直接放给他听。","id":195,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fb/Avg_avg_npc_893_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":196},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"......哎呀，雅拉奶奶~","id":197,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/97/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_893_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":198},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雅拉","text":"好了好了，再说我这次回哥伦比亚，可能也没有时间去见你爷爷。","id":199,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c9/Avg_avg_npc_893_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":200},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"对哦，您之前不是跑到雷姆必拓散心了吗，这次回来是为了莱茵生命的事情？","id":201,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_893_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":202},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雅拉","text":"别多问，小蒂比。","id":203,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ee/Avg_avg_npc_893_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"multiline","name":"雅拉","text":"展映会结束后，我还得跑一趟特区，去见见副总统阁下......","id":204},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_893_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":205},{"type":"multiline","name":"雅拉","end":"true","text":"所以，这会儿先让我和老朋友聊聊天吧。","id":206},{"type":"dialog","id":207},{"type":"charslot","id":208},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_highheeledshoe_carpet_fts","volume":"1","id":209},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1830_1#2$1","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","id":210},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":211},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"好久不见，玛丽安娜。","id":212,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_893_1#1$1","id":213},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雅拉","text":"叫我雅拉吧。","id":214,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c9/Avg_avg_npc_893_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雅拉","text":"息影几十年，“玛丽安娜”这个名字对我来说已经有些陌生了。","id":215,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c9/Avg_avg_npc_893_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1830_1#1$1","id":216},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"总之，还是要感谢你......雅拉。","id":217,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d1/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"你知道，凭我如今的影响力，确实很难在蓝卡坞说上什么话......","id":218,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d1/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"如果没有你的帮助，“另类电影节”不会在征选环节已经结束之后，破例允许《杜邦夫人》在电影节上展映。","id":219,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d1/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_893_1#1$1","id":220},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雅拉","text":"客气。","id":221,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c9/Avg_avg_npc_893_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1830_1#3$1","id":222},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"不过，我事先还真不知道蒂比这孩子竟然是......","id":223,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/59/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_893_1#1$1","id":224},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雅拉","text":"我愿意帮忙，倒和这个孩子没什么关系。","id":225,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c9/Avg_avg_npc_893_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雅拉","text":"我只不过是看了那段在天灾中的表演，觉得如果它不能被观众看到，实在是太过可惜，所以想要帮帮老朋友。","id":226,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c9/Avg_avg_npc_893_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1830_1#3$1","id":227},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"......","id":228,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/59/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_893_1#9$1","id":229},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雅拉","text":"不过，即使《杜邦夫人》在“另类电影节”上提前造势，可能对电影最后的票房成绩也起不到什么帮助。","id":230,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ee/Avg_avg_npc_893_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雅拉","text":"米兰妮，你比我更清楚，蓝卡坞如果是一个切实的人，那没有比他记性更差、包容心更小的人了......","id":231,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ee/Avg_avg_npc_893_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雅拉","text":"......他不一定真能接纳一个重回自己怀抱的恋人。","id":232,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ee/Avg_avg_npc_893_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雅拉","text":"更何况，你们毁坏了一整个地块，哪怕电影票房大卖，你们收回的钱也不够交付赔偿金的。","id":233,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ee/Avg_avg_npc_893_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1830_1#2$1","id":234},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"起码我这样去做了，起码我没有遗憾。","id":235,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1830_1#1$1","id":236},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"相比考虑这些，我......我更想问你一个问题。","id":237,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d1/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_893_1#9$1","id":238},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雅拉","text":"请说。","id":239,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ee/Avg_avg_npc_893_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1830_1#1$1","id":240},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"当初，你拍摄《在永夜里燃烧的晨星》时也遭遇了天灾，摄影机记录下了你与风暴擦肩而过的画面......","id":241,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d1/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"那究竟如你在发布会上所说，是一个意外，还是......","id":242,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d1/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"你也是主动走向前与它对戏的呢？","id":243,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d1/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_893_1#9$1","id":244},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雅拉","text":"......","id":245,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ee/Avg_avg_npc_893_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_893_1#1$1","id":246},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雅拉","text":"米兰妮，对现在的你来说，答案还重要吗？","id":247,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c9/Avg_avg_npc_893_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1830_1#1$1","id":248},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"......","id":249,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d1/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1830_1#2$1","id":250},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"哈哈哈哈，不重要。","id":251,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"唉，到头来，还是很难说赢过了你啊！","id":252,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":253},{"type":"text","text":"盛装的女主演在媒体的镜头前开怀大笑，她也不知道自己笑什么。","id":254},{"type":"text","text":"良久，她向着曾经的竞争对手，臆想中那个自己永远追不上的天才，曾经无数次在镜头前礼貌地行贴面礼的对象，张开了怀抱......","id":255},{"type":"text","text":"她们相拥。","id":256},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_893_1#1$1","id":257},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雅拉","text":"入场吧。","id":258,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c9/Avg_avg_npc_893_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":259},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_higheldshosfts","volume":"1","id":260},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","id":261},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":262},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":263},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":264},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":265},{"type":"charslot","id":266},{"type":"background","id":267},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_tvnoise","layer":"1","id":268},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":269},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_filmprojection","id":270},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_filmprojection_loop","loop":"true","channel":"bgs","delay":"0.5","id":271},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":272},{"type":"sticker","id":273,"text":"米兰妮·卢瑟福德   饰   杜邦夫人","delay":"0.001","width":"800","x":"250","y":"340","duration":"2","alignment":"center","size":"28"},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":274},{"type":"sticker","id":275,"duration":"2"},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":276},{"type":"sticker","id":277,"text":"迈克尔   饰   第一、第二、第三洛克菲勒","delay":"0.001","width":"800","x":"250","y":"340","duration":"2","alignment":"center","size":"28"},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":278},{"type":"sticker","id":279,"duration":"2"},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":280},{"type":"sticker","id":281,"text":"道尔顿   饰   杜邦爵士","delay":"0.001","width":"800","x":"250","y":"340","duration":"2","alignment":"center","size":"28"},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":282},{"type":"sticker","id":283,"duration":"2"},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":284},{"type":"sticker","id":285,"text":"卢西恩   饰   信使","delay":"0.001","width":"800","x":"250","y":"340","duration":"2","alignment":"center","size":"28"},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":286},{"type":"sticker","id":287,"duration":"2"},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":288},{"type":"sticker","id":289,"text":"......","delay":"0.001","width":"800","x":"250","y":"340","duration":"1","alignment":"center","size":"28"},{"type":"sticker","id":290,"duration":"1"},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":291},{"type":"sticker","id":292,"text":"制片人   格蕾塔·斯通","delay":"0.001","width":"800","x":"250","y":"250","duration":"1","alignment":"center","size":"24","block":"false"},{"type":"sticker","id":293,"text":"导演/编剧   斯蒂芬·奎","delay":"0.001","width":"800","x":"250","y":"350","duration":"1","alignment":"center","size":"24","block":"false"},{"type":"sticker","id":294,"text":"统筹   谢莉","delay":"0.001","width":"800","x":"250","y":"450","duration":"1","alignment":"center","size":"24","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":295,"duration":"1"},{"type":"sticker","id":296,"duration":"1"},{"type":"sticker","id":297,"duration":"1"},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":298},{"type":"sticker","id":299,"text":"美术部门   卡尔，鲍勃，蒂比，杰里科尔......","delay":"0.001","width":"800","x":"250","y":"200","duration":"1","alignment":"center","size":"24","block":"false"},{"type":"sticker","id":300,"text":"摄制部门   阿布纳，列尔......","delay":"0.001","width":"800","x":"250","y":"300","duration":"1","alignment":"center","size":"24","block":"false"},{"type":"sticker","id":301,"text":"服装部门   玛丽昂......","delay":"0.001","width":"800","x":"250","y":"400","duration":"1","alignment":"center","size":"24","block":"false"},{"type":"sticker","id":302,"text":"道具部门   莫伊拉......","delay":"0.001","width":"800","x":"250","y":"500","duration":"1","alignment":"center","size":"24","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":303,"duration":"1"},{"type":"sticker","id":304,"duration":"1"},{"type":"sticker","id":305,"duration":"1"},{"type":"sticker","id":306,"duration":"1"},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":307},{"type":"sticker","id":308,"text":"......","delay":"0.001","width":"800","x":"250","y":"250","duration":"1","alignment":"center","size":"24","block":"false"},{"type":"sticker","id":309,"text":"场务部门   霍汀......","delay":"0.001","width":"800","x":"250","y":"350","duration":"1","alignment":"center","size":"24","block":"false"},{"type":"sticker","id":310,"text":"......","delay":"0.001","width":"800","x":"250","y":"450","duration":"1","alignment":"center","size":"24","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":311,"duration":"1"},{"type":"sticker","id":312,"duration":"1"},{"type":"sticker","id":313,"duration":"1"},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":314},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_filmprojection","id":315},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"0.5","id":316},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":317},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","id":318},{"type":"bgeffect","id":319},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/50/Avg_62_i11_1.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":320},{"type":"imagetween","xScaleFrom":"1.1","yScaleFrom":"1.1","xScaleTo":"1","yScaleTo":"1","duration":"30","block":"false","id":321},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":322},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":323},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":324},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/rogue_1/m_sys_rglk1secretstage_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":325,"musicid":2},{"type":"dialogue","name":"观众A","text":"......结束了？","id":326},{"type":"dialogue","name":"观众B","text":"结束了。","id":327},{"type":"dialogue","name":"观众A","text":"你觉得这部电影怎么样？","id":328},{"type":"dialogue","name":"观众B","text":"我听说了一些这个剧组经历的事情，命案啊天灾啊什么的，项目管理一塌糊涂......","id":329},{"type":"dialogue","name":"观众B","text":"进场之前，我以为电影本身会远不如这些八卦有意思。结果......","id":330},{"type":"dialogue","name":"观众B","text":"一场荒唐的贵族婚变，最后以天灾收尾——所有的反转都在情理之中，但好多人物的行为都透露着几分诡异......","id":331},{"type":"dialogue","name":"观众B","text":"虽然很难给出一个好或者坏的评价，但还挺值得玩味的。","id":332},{"type":"dialogue","name":"观众A","text":"说实话，我也是。","id":333},{"type":"dialogue","name":"观众A","text":"抛开故事不谈，它的制作也应该很有争议，毕竟连拍摄风格都不统一......","id":334},{"type":"dialogue","name":"观众A","text":"前面是精致细腻的正剧拍法，越到后面反而越粗糙，尤其是天灾那几场高潮戏，完全变成了纪录片！","id":335},{"type":"dialogue","name":"观众A","text":"喜欢的观众会给它打满分，讨厌的观众估计也不会留情。","id":336},{"type":"dialogue","name":"观众B","text":"话又说回来，很有意思，不是吗？","id":337},{"type":"dialogue","name":"观众B","text":"这几年，蓝卡坞越来越没有意思了，就连在这“另类电影节”上放的电影，也越来越不另类......","id":338},{"type":"dialogue","name":"观众B","text":"起码这部《杜邦夫人》，我愿意为它买一张电影票。","id":339},{"type":"dialogue","name":"观众A","text":"等会儿映后谈的时候，看主创们怎么说吧。","id":340},{"type":"dialogue","name":"观众A","text":"对了，听说最前排那个一脸倒霉样的家伙，就是剧组的成员来着......","id":341},{"type":"dialog","id":342},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":343},{"type":"dialogue","name":"霍汀","text":"呼......真倒霉。","id":344},{"type":"dialogue","name":"霍汀","text":"申请了一个月，好不容易作为最后一个场工被招进剧组，结果一进去就发生了那么多事，还撞见了尸体，失眠了好几晚......","id":345},{"type":"dialogue","name":"霍汀","text":"要不是失眠，也不会在靠近天灾的时候，明明都跟着大家躲进了动力层，安全了，结果还是因为恍惚踢到墙壁，脚骨折了......","id":346},{"type":"dialogue","name":"霍汀","text":"要不是脚骨折了，也不会错过公交车，连这场电影的前一半都没有赶上......","id":347},{"type":"text","text":"字幕在滚动着，倒霉的场工喃喃自语，她想起自己这段时间的经历，不禁有些悲从中来。","id":348},{"type":"text","text":"就连银幕上那些画面，她也觉得陌生，那些熟悉的面孔、熟悉的场景以一种她无法理解的方式被组合在了一起......","id":349},{"type":"text","text":"就像她“跌宕起伏”的人生。","id":350},{"type":"text","text":"然后，她在演职员表的最后看到了自己的名字。","id":351},{"type":"dialogue","name":"霍汀","text":"“场务部门：霍汀”......","id":352},{"type":"text","text":"命运的手再怎么翻覆，也终归要落下一行，你所确信的，真实。","id":353},{"type":"dialog","id":354},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_footsteps_flock","volume":"1","id":355},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":356},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":357},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9c/Avg_62_i11_2.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":358},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":359},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_spotlight","volume":"1","id":360},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":361},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":362},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧作家","text":"放映结束了，你不去参加映后谈？","id":363},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"我不属于他们。更何况......你们来了。","id":364},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧作家","text":"哈，也是。","id":365},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧作家","text":"对了，很精彩......无论是戏里，还是戏外。","id":366},{"type":"dialogue","name":"暮落","text":"卢西恩......","id":367},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"嗯？","id":368},{"type":"dialogue","name":"暮落","text":"他这次是真的死了？","id":369},{"type":"dialogue","name":"暮落","text":"还是说，他依旧以某种方式活着？","id":370},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"这是我需要思考的问题。","id":371},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"暮落，你只需知道，你不必在即使躲藏于罗德岛上的时候，也依然忧心会被过往的阴影侵入梦境......","id":372},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"剧作家，你可以尽情创作自己的剧本，任何题材、任何风格......","id":373},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"猩红剧团不复存在，你们自由了。","id":374},{"type":"dialogue","name":"暮落","text":"......","id":375},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧作家","text":"......","id":376},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧作家","text":"那你呢？","id":377},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧作家","text":"你刚刚说，你仍需要思考有关他的结局——也就是说，你无法从这条路上离开，对吧？","id":378},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧作家","text":"“戏剧不死”......坐在我旁边的，不再是“血钻”，而是，“酒神”？","id":379},{"type":"dialogue","name":"暮落","text":"卢西恩，听起来，你付出了很多代价......","id":380},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"谈不上。","id":381},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2c/Avg_62_i11_3.png","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"0.5","id":382},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"如若说，此前我们连复仇或逃遁都是被写就的剧本，那么此刻，我们终于得以走进未来。","id":383},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"我会重新开始游历、歌唱、演出，直到我确信我所形塑的事物，足以匹配我的喜悦和痛苦......","id":384},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9c/Avg_62_i11_2.png","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"0.5","id":385},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"它可能是一个新的剧团或主张，一些新的奇遇与故事，或者，更刺眼的明天，更惨烈的真相......","id":386},{"type":"dialogue","name":"暮落","text":"......","id":387},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧作家","text":"......","id":388},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧作家","text":"喂，暮落，怎么说也算是老熟人了......要帮他吗？","id":389},{"type":"dialogue","name":"暮落","text":"卢西恩，你、你有信心吗？","id":390},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"当然。","id":391},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"奔突于迷途者，闭塞了感识与内心的苦行人，在伟大与低微中跋涉的凡俗，咀嚼着痛苦的生灵......","id":392},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"这片大地从来都不缺演员。","id":393},{"type":"dialog","id":394},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_spotlightc","volume":"1","id":395},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":396},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":397},{"type":"image","id":398},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b8/Avg_62_i11_4.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":399},{"type":"imagetween","xScaleFrom":"1","yScaleFrom":"1","xScaleTo":"1.05","yScaleTo":"1.05","duration":"10","block":"false","id":400},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":401},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_spotlight","volume":"1","id":402},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":403},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":404},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"......欢迎你们，加入“剧团”。","id":405},{"type":"dialog","id":406},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":407},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":408},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":409},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":410},{"type":"charslot","id":411},{"type":"background","id":412},{"type":"image","id":413}],"characters":["蒂比","莫伊拉","斯蒂芬","格蕾塔","米兰妮","兴奋的记者A","兴奋的记者B","雅拉","观众A","观众B","霍汀","剧作家","卢西恩","暮落"]}